   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "was: what",
     "texto": [
      "**Was** is used after words like **alles** (everything), **nichts** (nothing), **etwas** (something) or **das** (that) when there isn't a specific noun: **Alles, was ich weiß** (everything I know). **Das ist alles, was wichtig ist** (that's all that's important).",
      "With **was** the verb of the relative clause goes at the end."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "wo: where",
     "texto": [
      "**Wo** is the relative of place and is used with a place noun: **Die Stadt, wo ich geboren bin** (the city where I was born). In formal text one also says **in der** / **in dem**: **Die Stadt, in der ich geboren bin**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
